# Resource (kurrentcloud_managed_cluster_replicaset)

Manages the read-only replica set attached to a Kurrent Cloud managed cluster.

The Kurrent Cloud API exposes at most one read-only replica set per cluster, so this resource is keyed by the parent cluster's ID. To work with replicas, configure a `kurrentcloud_managed_cluster` and reference its `id` from this resource's `cluster_id`.

When `protected = true`, the API will reject deletion of the replica set; flip `protected` back to `false` and re-apply before destroying.

